#==============================================================================================
#
#   event_loop_1 - HTML::EventLoop: construction, scheduling, spinning, the processing model
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/EventLoop/EventLoop.cpp (lines 37-300): the constructor
#       and visit_edges, scheduling a round of processing on a Platform::Timer (the embedder's
#       loop runs it through the Core event loop seam), the main thread's event loop, spinning
#       the event loop, the event loop processing model (one task, then a microtask
#       checkpoint), queueing the rendering update task, and handing the pages' queued input
#       events to the pages.
